  "required": ["zone_id", "phase", "flow_rate_lpm", "duration"],
  "properties": {
    "zone_id": {"type": "string", "example": "zone-7f3a"},
    "phase": {"type": "string", "enum": ["irrigation", "lighting", "combined"]},
    "flow_rate_lpm": {"type": "integer", "description": "Flow rate in liters/min; integer only"},
    "duration": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["value", "unit"],
      "properties": {
        "value": {"type": "integer"},
        "unit": {"type": "string", "enum": ["minutes", "hours"]}
      }
    }
  }
}
```

So the user's SDK probably sends fields like `flow` or `flow_rate` instead of `flow_rate_lpm`, and maybe `duration_minutes` instead of the nested `duration` object.

I need to send:
- zone_id: "zone-2c19"
- phase: "lighting"
- flow_rate_lpm: 8
- duration: {"value": 45, "unit": "minutes"}

